# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules. Astro's `redirects` config sends / to /en/,
# so the root is handled by the build.
#
# The old site's URLs are not typed here. scripts/legacy-redirects.mjs appends
# them to dist/_redirects after every build, from a map of old page to new page
# plus the old slugs in legacy-export/normalized, and fails the build if any of
# them would point at a page that does not exist. Edit the map there.
#
# Hand-written rules can still go above this line; the generated block is
# appended after them.
